  "details": "Good day, I personally encountered such a problem that in VRchat my microphone is obviously quiet, whether it is connected with the game itself, the operating system or the drivers, I can’t understand, I tried everything, and I got an idea. the game has a function to increase the volume of its microphone, then why not add a function to additionally increase the volume? sometimes people cannot solve their problems through computer settings, then why not help them with in-game settings?",
